   "id": 50,
   "type": "state-timeline",
   "title": "Worker lifecycle state (per worker and state)",
   "description": "inference_worker_state \u2014 one series per (worker, state). READY must dominate; WARMING/UNHEALTHY bands are restarts; DEGRADED bands are accumulating failures (connect blips, empty completions, stalls).",
